## Work graphs

Recurring multi-agent procedures are generated as Workflow scripts in `.claude/workflows/`. Run one by name with the Workflow tool instead of re-deriving the same fan-out by hand.

{{workflows_markdown}}

Every loop in a graph carries an explicit termination condition and a hard iteration cap, and reports when it stops at the cap. Graphs are generated from the profile: edit `graphs` and re-render rather than editing the scripts, which are overwritten.

{{agent_sessions_section}}

## Safety

Follow `AGENTS.md`. Do not broaden permissions to make a task easier. Do not activate hooks, bypass permissions, push, or deploy without explicit authorization.
